            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a battery pack (120) comprising a unit module stack formed by stacking a plurality of unit modules (121A), each unit module (121A) having a plurality of battery cells (121) stacked on each other; a swelling absorption pad (126) interposed between the unit modules (121A) adjacent to each other; and a pack housing (123) configured to accommodate the unit module stack and the swelling absorption pad (126), wherein the swelling absorption pad (126) has a coolant channel (P) formed to extend along a longitudinal direction thereof; and also relates to a battery rack and an energy storage system including the same.</p>
